        "username": "dypaca",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/dypaca/{size}/2079_2.png",
        "created_at": "2013-06-28T05:39:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>You can deal yourself 5 damage in this case. &nbsp;However, if you are incapacitated your cards will leave the game and you will not get to deal damage to another target. &nbsp;So long as you have Aegis of Ressurrection (or Fixed point) in play, though, you can survive going into negative HP and deal the full 5 damage to another target. (or more if you managed to take additional radiant damage this turn)</p>",
        "post_number": 2,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T02:44:28.540Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
        "reply_to_post_number": null,
